<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>1.6.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00147</md:content-id>
    <md:title>1.6.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>44ea401f-1a69-453b-8c3c-6cfe69540a0d</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para class="os-raise-text-bold"><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated"> <item><emphasis>Select three</emphasis> the equations that have the same solution as the equation \( 3x-12=24 \).</item></list>
<list>
   <item>  \(15x-60=120 \)</item>
    <item> \( 3x=12 \)</item>
    <item> \( 3x=36 \)</item>
    <item> \( x-4=8 \)</item>
    <item> \( 12x-12=24 \)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis>
    </para><list>
    <item>\(15x-60=120 \)</item>
    <item>\( 3x=36 \)</item>
    <item>\( x-4=8 \)</item>
</list>

<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated"> <item><emphasis>Select three</emphasis> the equations that have the same solution as \( 2x-5=15 \).</item></list>
<list>
    <item> \(2x=10 \)</item>
    <item> \( 2x=20 \)</item>
    <item> \( 2(x-5)=15 \)</item>
    <item> \( 2x-20=0 \)</item>
    <item> \( 4x-10=30 \)</item>
    <item> \( 15=5-2x \)</item>  
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis>
    </para><list>
        <item>\( 2x=20 \)</item>
        <item>\( 2x-20=0 \)</item>
        <item>\( 4x-10=30 \)</item>
    </list>
    
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated"> <item><emphasis>Select four</emphasis> of the equations that are equivalent to \( x + 0.4x - 4.2 =12.8 \).</item></list>
<list>
    <item> \(1.4x - 4.2 =12.8 \)</item>
    <item> \( 1.4x = 8.6 \)</item>
    <item> \( 1.4x = 17 \)</item>
    <item> \( 14x - 42 =128 \)</item>
    <item> \( 10x +4x -42=12.8 \)</item>
    <item> \( 14x =170 \)</item>
    </list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis>
    </para><list>
        <item>\(1.4x - 4.2 =12.8 \)</item>
        <item>\( 1.4x = 17 \)</item>
        <item>\( 14x - 42 =128 \)</item>
        <item>\( 14x =170 \)</item>

    </list>
    
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated"> <item><emphasis>Select two </emphasis>of the equations that are equivalent to \( 3x -6 =12 \).</item></list>
<list>
    <item>\( 3x = 6 \)</item>
    <item> \( 3(x-2) = 12 \)</item>
    <item> \( x - 2 =4 \)</item>
    <item> \( x - 2 = 12 \)</item>
    <item> \( x -6 = 4 \)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>
    </para><list>
        <item>\( 3(x-2) = 12 \)</item>
        <item>\( x - 2 =4 \)</item>
    </list>
    
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated"><item> Identify the step in which the mistake is made in finding an equivalent equation to \( 2(x - 4) = 16 \).</item></list>
<para>Step 1: \( 2x -4 = 16 \)Step 2: \( 2x =20 \)Step 3: \( x =10 \)</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> Step 1. Distribute the 2 to both terms in the parentheses.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated"> <item>Identify the step in which the mistake is made in finding an equivalent equation to \( 2x +3x -4 = 20 \).</item></list>
<para>Step 1: \( 5x - 4 =20 \)Step 2: \( 5x = 16 \)Step 3: \( x = \frac{16}{5} \)</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> Step 2. The student should add 4 to both sides of the equation.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated"> <item>Identify the step in which the mistake is made in finding an equivalent equation to \( 7x - 4x - 5 =16 \).</item></list>
<para>Step 1: \( 3x -5 =16 \)Step 2: \( 3x = 21 \)Step 3: \( x =62 \)</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> Step 3. The student should divide both sides of the equation by 3.
</para><list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated"> <item>Fill in the blank to complete the equivalent equation to \( 3(x - 5) = 30 \).</item></list>
<para>\( 3x -  \) ____ \( = 30 \)</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 15. Distribute the 3 to the 5 with multiplication.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated"> <item>Fill in the blank to complete the equivalent equation to \( \frac{x}{2}-5=11 \).</item></list>
<para>\( x - \) ______ \( = 22 \)</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 10</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated"> <item>Fill in the blank to complete the equivalent equation to \( 3(x - 9) = 24 \).</item>
</list>
<para>\( x - \) ____ \( = 8 \)</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 9</para>
</section>
